  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:330px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Accelerated Assimilation</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/38/Popeye_Spinach.png/revision/latest?cb=20180801010221\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Popeye Spinach\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/38/Popeye_Spinach.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180801010221\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/38/Popeye_Spinach.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20180801010221 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/38/Popeye_Spinach.png/revision/latest?cb=20180801010221 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Popeye Spinach\" width=\"270\" height=\"377\" data-image-key=\"Popeye_Spinach.png\" data-image-name=\"Popeye Spinach.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Popeye the Sailor (Popeye) assimilates rapidly to spinach's healthy properties acquiring superhuman strength.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Assimilate quickly consumed substances into one's system.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>assimilate quickly consumed substances into one's system</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAccelerated_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Accelerated Intake</li>\n<li>Speed Assimilation</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAccelerated_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can eat, drink, inject themselves, inhale or otherwise absorb any substance and assimilate it into their bloodstream at an accelerated rate. Usually it takes time for something to be assimilated into the bloodstream after consumption, but for user of this power, seconds become fractions of seconds, minutes become seconds, hours become minutes, etc.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAccelerated_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Empowerment\" title=\"Absorption Empowerment\">Absorption Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Metabolism/Accelerated\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peak Human Metabolism/Accelerated\">Accelerated Metabolism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Trait:Chemical-Based_Powers\" title=\"Trait:Chemical-Based Powers\">Chemical-Based Powers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Manipulation\" title=\"Digestive Manipulation\">Digestive Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Drink_Empowerment\" title=\"Drink Empowerment\">Drink Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Empowerment\" title=\"Energy Empowerment\">Energy Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Food_Empowerment\" title=\"Food Empowerment\">Food Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infection_Empowerment\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Infection Empowerment\">Infection Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ingestion_Transformation\" title=\"Ingestion Transformation\">Ingestion Transformation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Ingestion\" title=\"Matter Ingestion\">Matter Ingestion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Bestowal\" title=\"Self-Power Bestowal\">Self-Power Bestowal</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAccelerated_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much one can assimilate at a time.</li>\n<li>May be limited to what one can assimilate.</li>\n<li>Can die quickly if they eat dangerous materials such as poisons unless they have <a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Metabolism/Accelerated\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peak Human Metabolism/Accelerated\">Accelerated Metabolism</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Contaminant_Immunity\" title=\"Contaminant Immunity\">Contaminant Immunity</a>.</li>\n<li>The effects of the consumed substance can wear of just as quickly.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAccelerated_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Steve (<i>Minecraft</i>)</li>\n<li>Monkey. D. Luffy (<i>One Piece</i>) via Meat</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Popeye\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Popeye\">Popeye the Sailor</a> (<i>Popeye</i>) via Spinach</li>\n<li>Users of Gourmet cells (<i>Toriko</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260805005927\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 104/100000